    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντέγκειμαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>to be urgent on the other side,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.470B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be inserted in place of</i> another letter (as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ε</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1863.56
			</span></i>.</div>
